[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7266.31, "timestamp": "02:01:06", "text": "。 共和党人真的很厉害。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7269.83, "timestamp": "02:01:09", "text": "歌词意味深长，一切都太棒了。 所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7273.91, "timestamp": "02:01:13", "text": "他们都希望我能回归"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7277.51, "timestamp": "02:01:17", "text": "音乐事业。 我需要……我正在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7279.589, "timestamp": "02:01:19", "text": "玩游戏和做其他事情。 这是什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7283.189, "timestamp": "02:01:23", "text": "？ 有人留下的吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7286.55, "timestamp": "02:01:26", "text": "呃，看，一个可爱的小东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7309.51, "timestamp": "02:01:49", "text": "相机在哪儿？"}]